Due to these results, I'm was not sure if I understood correctly the methodology used to estimate the SV model.I'll see if I can improve the estimation by changing the settings on the numerical approximations used in INLA. As there was also a change in the configuration of precision parameter  (for marginal precision) in latent AR model, it might be possible to improve results with other settings.

One quick question - the version of the article to be published in The European Journal of Finance is very different from the technical report? I do not have access to this journal.

